    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p>At Anaplan, we are a team of innovators focused on optimizing business decision-making through our leading AI-infused scenario planning and analysis platform so our customers can outpace their competition and the market.</p> <p>What unites Anaplanners across teams and geographies is our collective commitment to our customers’ success and to our Winning Culture.</p> <p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Our customers rank among the who’s who in the Fortune 50. Coca-Cola, LinkedIn, Adobe, LVMH and Bayer are just a few of the 2,400+ global companies who rely on our best-in-class platform.</p> <p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Our Winning Culture is the engine that drives our teams of innovators. We champion diversity of thought and ideas, we behave like leaders regardless of title, we are committed to achieving ambitious goals, and we love celebrating<em> </em>our wins – big and small.</p> <p>Supported by operating principles of being strategy-led, <a href=\"https://www.anaplan.com/careers/\">values</a>-based and disciplined in execution, you’ll be inspired, connected, developed and rewarded here. Everything that makes you unique is welcome; join us and let’s build what’s next - together!</p></div><p><span data-contrast=\"none\">The Delivery Assurance (DA) Solution Architect is a critical, senior role within Anaplan's professional services organisation, acting as the primary guardian of technical quality and implementation health for our most strategic customer projects. This role is not about hands-on building; it is about providing expert peer review, architectural governance, and risk mitigation to ensure every Anaplan solution is scalable, performant, and aligned with our highest best-practice standards, ultimately leading to zero troubled deployments.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 4\">Core Responsibilities &amp; Day-to-Day Tasks:</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Execute the DA Framework:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"> Systematically conduct architectural and design reviews at key project milestones (e.g., Entitlement, Data Integration, Model Build, Go-Live) using standardised DA checklists and applications. Maintain the DA Progress Tracker, including updating KPI scores, logging detailed notes, and tracking project documentation.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Drive Accountability:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;While not responsible for the \"fixing,\" the DA Architect&nbsp;is responsible for&nbsp;holding implementation teams accountable for executing remediation plans and adjusting timelines accordingly.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Manage Escalations:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"> Act as the first line of defence in identifying project risks. When issues are blocked or ignored, execute the standard escalation path, from flagging risks in the DA tracker for leadership visibility to engaging with Anaplan account leadership and, if necessary, the customer sponsor.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Interface with Customer and partner teams:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Facilitate&nbsp;a three-way conversation on milestone review outcomes and next steps, providing visibility to the customer and partnership to the delivery team.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Act as a Technical Advisor:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Serve as a trusted expert for partners and internal teams, providing guidance on complex modelling logic, platform capabilities (e.g., Polaris vs. Classic), and strategies for handling App extensions and upgradability.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Identify&nbsp;and Document Risk:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;Proactively&nbsp;identify, document, and assess technical and architectural risks, using the DA Checklist application to flag issues and provide specific, actionable best-practice guidance to implementation teams.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Facilitate Remediation &amp; Educational Workshops</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">: After completing a checklist, lead sign-off meetings with partner and customer stakeholders to review findings, prioritise high-impact issues, and collaboratively formulate an action plan. When necessary, design and lead optional, targeted educational workshops (e.g., clarifying UAT vs. SIT testing methodologies) to ensure partners and customers fully grasp complex concepts and the \"why\" behind a required remediation.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Interface with Internal Teams:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">When platform-level issues are&nbsp;identified, serve as the liaison with Anaplan's internal ecosystem</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">What We Need in a Delivery Assurance Architect:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Deep Technical Acumen:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">You are a seasoned Anaplan expert with a Master&nbsp;Anaplanner&nbsp;or senior Solution Architect background. You can instantly recognize architectural anti-patterns, diagnose performance bottlenecks, and provide credible, expert-level design recommendations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Process Discipline:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">You are methodical and structured. You understand the value of following a standardised framework and using designated tools to ensure every review is consistent, auditable, and complete.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Consultative Communication:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;You&nbsp;possess&nbsp;exceptional communication and negotiation skills. You can tactfully deliver critical feedback, challenge a flawed design decision, and guide a partner toward the correct solution without creating friction. You know how to be an advisor, not just an auditor.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Unflinching Accountability:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">You are not afraid to have difficult conversations. You can comfortably escalate issues, hold teams accountable for their commitments, and clearly articulate the consequences of ignoring best-practice guidance.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Pragmatic Problem-Solving:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">You can analyse complex, real-world project scenarios and apply a decision-making framework that balances architectural purity, project timelines, and customer requirements to achieve the best possible outcome.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Executive Presence:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">You can synthesise and communicate complex technical findings into a clear, high-level summary for non-technical stakeholders, including customer teams and Anaplan account leadership.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 4\">Key Outcomes &amp; Measures of Success:</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"9\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Zero Troubled Deployments</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"9\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Accelerated Time-to-Value (TTV)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"9\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Protected Commercial Value (Renewals &amp; Expansion)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"9\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Elevated Ecosystem Capability</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"9\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">100% \"No Surprises\" Visibility: You&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;an accurate, up-to-date audit trail in the DA Progress Tracker</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><strong>Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) </strong></p> <p>We believe attracting and retaining the best talent and fostering an inclusive culture strengthens our business. DEIB improves our workforce, enhances trust with our partners and customers, and drives business success. Build your career in a place where diversity, equity, inclusion and belonging aren’t just words on paper – this is what drives our innovation, it’s how we connect, and it contributes to what makes us a market leader. We believe in a hiring and working environment where all people are respected and valued, regardless of gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, ethnicity, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, or any other aspect which makes people unique. We hire you for who you are, and we want you to bring your authentic self to work every day! </p> <p>We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive equitable benefits and all privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation. &nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Fraud Recruitment Disclaimer</strong> &nbsp;</p> <p>It has come to our attention that fraudulent and fictitious job opportunities are being circulated on the Internet. Prospective candidates are being contacted by certain individuals, mainly through telephone calls, emails and correspondence, claiming they are representatives of Anaplan. The main purpose of these correspondences and announcements is to obtain privileged information from individuals. </p> <p>Anaplan does not: &nbsp;</p> <ul> <li>Extend offers to candidates without an extensive interview process with a member of our recruitment team and a hiring manager via video or in person. &nbsp;</li> <li>Send job offers via email. All offers are first extended verbally by a member of our internal recruitment team whenever possible and then followed up via written communication. &nbsp;</li> </ul> <p>All emails from Anaplan would come from an ----- email address. Should you have any doubts about the authenticity of an email, letter or telephone communication purportedly from, for, or on behalf of Anaplan, please send an email to ----- before taking any further action in relation to the correspondence. &nbsp;</p> <p><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">C</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">andidate data processed during our recruitment activities is handled </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">in accordance with</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\"> our Candidate Privacy Notice. This may include the use of artificial intelligence or automated tools to </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">assist</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\"> our team in evaluating qualifications.</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p></div> Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
