            schema:name "London" ] ;
    schema:title "DevOps Engineer (FTC)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/bluecrestcapitalmanagement/devops-engineer-ftc-london-460271> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-director-ai-automation-onemedia-germany-munich-91702> a prov:Entity,
