    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/mammutmarsch-ug/junior-marketing-manager-danmark-berlin-117393> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-junior-software-engineer-london-459866> a prov:Entity,
