    schema:description "We're building an AI employee to manage commercial partnerships end to end. We are freshly funded from leading VCs, and looing for an AI savvy product manager to help us deliver more value to our awesome customers Tasks 0-1 product prototyping and ownership of making sure things get built well You will closeley collaborate with engineers, a designer and the founders Analyze market trends and customer feedback to identify opportunities for product improvement. Oversee the product development process from ideation to launch. Requirements Proven experience as a Product Manager in a tech environment. AI native and a builder. You don't need to be a full stack engineer, but you should be able to use AI tools to go 0-1 Excellent communication skills to collaborate with cross-functional teams. Ability to analyze market trends and user feedback for product improvement. Experience in a Seed - Series B stage buiness Benefits Equity, team trips and more A great opportunity for someone looking to jumpo into the deep end and have ownership from day 1 Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
