    schema:datePosted "2026-08-25"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "What you can expect from us As part of our Sourcing & IT Advisory team, you will help clients shape and deliver complex business and IT transformations across industries. Our tasks focus on complex transformation projects: Enterprise Architecture & Strategy: Define enterprise architecture strategies, governance models, target architectures, and roadmaps aligned with business objectives and value streams Business & Application Architecture: Design business capabilities, processes, application portfolios, and platform landscapes to enable scalable digital operating models Data & Integration Architecture: Develop modern information, data, API-first, integration, and event-driven architectures that ensure interoperability and business value Legacy Modernization & Technical Debt: Lead the transition from legacy and monolithic environments to cloud-native, modular, microservices-based architectures. Help clients to harmonize their diverse technology landscapes, work on their technical debt, and guide their IT migrations Technology Transformation: Design multi and hybrid cloud environments and new platforms reflecting requirements such as cloud migration and cloud exit options, business process resilience, open-source solutions, maintainability, and DevOps organizations and processes AI Architecture & Innovation: Drive AI readiness, define architectures for AI-enabled and agentic systems, and champion the effective use of AI tools to accelerate architecture, delivery, and decision-making Architecture Governance: Establish architecture principles, standards, processes, and decision frameworks to ensure sustainable enterprise-wide adoption Transformation Delivery: Advise business and IT stakeholders up to executive level, facilitate workshops, apply agile methodologies (e.g., SAFe), and ensure successful implementation of architectural change Who you are University degree in Computer Science, Business Informatics, Information Systems, Business Administration, or a related field At least 4 years proven experience in Enterprise and IT Architecture, ideally across multiple industries Proficient in leveraging modern AI tools to improve architecture design, consulting, and delivery, with a mindset of continuously exploring and adopting emerging AI capabilities Excellent communication skills in English and German Willingness to travel as required for client engagements Strong expertise in: Enterprise Architecture frameworks (e.g., TOGAF), Architecture Governance, and Architecture Maturity Assessments Business Capability Management, Business-IT Alignment, IT Strategy, and IT Governance Business, Application, Information, Data, Integration, Technology, and Security Architecture API-first, event-driven, service-oriented, cloud-native, and microservices architectures Data management concepts (e.g., master data management, data lakes, data mesh) Enterprise platforms (e.g., SAP, Salesforce, ServiceNow) Architecture modeling standards (e.g., ArchiMate) AI readiness, agentic AI architectures, and modern AI-enabled enterprise platforms Who we are We are a global digital transformation consulting firm with offices in Hamburg, Düsseldorf, Munich, Vienna, Atlanta, Singapore, and Shanghai. Since 2006, we have primarily advised DAX and Fortune Global 500 companies on digital transformation issues at the intersection of business and IT. Our strength lies in a comprehensive management-level consulting approach that ranges from IT strategy to the optimization and implementation of digitalization and transformation processes. For this, we have repeatedly been recognized by our clients and the business magazine BrandEins as “Best Consultants” and by Wirtschaftswoche as the winner of the “Best of Consulting” competition. A few of our great benefits: A \"Duz-Kultur\", short communication channels, and many fantastic, experienced, and international colleagues International company events that are truly worthwhile — both professionally and personally Want a Deutschlandticket? We cover half the cost Childcare subsidy — we pay half the daycare costs for your little ones JobRad bike leasing and discounted gym membership (EGYM Wellpass) Personalized professional development opportunities that help you grow both professionally and personally Central location in downtown Hamburg and Munich with excellent bus and train connections — and hub locations in all major German cities Fresh fruit, good coffee, snacks, soft drinks, and after-work beer—we’ve got it all Contact If you have any questions in advance, please contact Carolin Hilden at career.de. Our top priority is that you fit in with us and we with you, regardless of origin, nationality, sexual orientation, religion, gender identity, age, disability or other aspects of diversity. Please apply via our company portal with your CV and / or your updated Xing or Linked In profile. Are you interested in what our employees and other applicants say about us? Visit us on Kununu and follow us on social media to make sure you don't miss the latest news about us. Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
