    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/distribusion-technologies/remote-senior-engineering-manager-infrastructure-all-genders-berlin-73042> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-remote-senior-full-stack-engineer-berlin-12301> a prov:Entity,
        schema:JobPosting ;
    dcterms:source <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/source/arbeitnow> ;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-08-25T22:33:23+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/natuvion-gmbh/remote-senior-full-stack-engineer-berlin-12301> ;
    kgjobs:active true ;
    kgjobs:canonicalFingerprint "065ef424de11b84060a1657e16d0b53e4cb0e7060b4c87c17fa65df702671ecb" ;
    kgjobs:classification "not_match" ;
    kgjobs:firstSeenAt "2026-08-25T20:35:11+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:lastSeenAt "2026-08-25T22:33:23+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "remote-senior-full-stack-engineer-berlin-12301" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-08-25"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "We are a small engineering team inside Natuvion that finds and builds the next high-value additions to Natuvion's product portfolio. We build DCS Compose, a modern language for enterprise data transformations with deep integration into the Natuvion Cloud. Our work has three main aspects Understanding the domain. We make Natuvion's transformation knowledge searchable, structured, and available to AI agents. Hundreds of customer projects have produced millions of lines of transformation content. We build the infrastructure that turns this accumulated knowledge into a usable asset. User focused development. We understand our users and develop tools and applications for them. Our mission is to help our users excel at their work by providing them with the technical means to do so. Technical ownership. We develop solutions with deep integration into Natuvion's cloud landscape. We develop the backend and frontend functionality keeping in mind performance, adaptability and correctness. We build on top of the Natuvion Cloud, using its APIs and shared components as our foundation. The cloud team scales the platform; we focus on what to build on it. The team has strong technical and scientific backgrounds. We care about quality even in prototypes: Disciplined engineering, not vibe-coding. We're part of Natuvion (~500 employees, SAP Gold Partner). That means access to enterprise customers, real transformation projects, and corporate backing, with the autonomy of a small team. Why Join Us Real problems, not toy projects. Enterprise data transformations involve millions of records, complex business rules, and tight timelines. The prototypes you build here solve real problems for real customers. End-to-end ownership. From observing a process in a customer project to shipping a working prototype. You decide what to build and how. AI as a daily tool, not a buzzword. We use agentic coding and AI-assisted development and help the organization with AI usage. Small team, big reach. A few people with direct access to enterprise customers like BMW, Volkswagen, E.ON and Lufthansa, a cloud platform to build on, and the freedom to move fast. Your Responsibilities Build features for the DCS Compose application on top of the Natuvion Cloud: frontend, backend, and API integrations. Develop UI components for the content corpus: search interfaces, data visualization, and comparison tools. Integrate AI capabilities into applications: MCP, semantic search, and embeddings. Use and extend NCP's shared frontend components and APIs as building blocks for new solutions. Maintain quality standards: testing, code review, and clean architecture — even when moving fast. Your Profile Strong frontend and backend skills. You're comfortable building both sides of a web application. Experience with API design and consuming platform APIs. Familiarity with modern TypeScript, React (preferrably NextJS) and Golang. Knowledge in Protobuf and gRPC is a plus. An eye for good UI. You build interfaces people actually want to use. Quality discipline. You write tests, you review code, and you care about maintainability. How We Work Prototyping with standards. We ship fast, but not at all costs. Prototypes have tests, clean APIs, and documentation. When a prototype proves its value, it should be ready to hand off and not rewritten from scratch. Our current stack: Golang, gRPC, TypeScript, NextJS. We build on Natuvion Cloud's APIs and shared frontend components. The stack evolves as the problems do. We pick the right tool, not the familiar one. Agentic coding as a discipline. We use AI-assisted development tools daily. We hold the same quality standards whether code was written by a human or an agent. What you can expect from us An environment that is always open to change and optimization. There is no \"it's always been like this\" with us. You have the opportunity to contribute your knowledge, design processes, standardize existing topics or optimize workflows. Be a source of inspiration and bring us even further forward with your expertise! We create conditions in which you feel comfortable Home office contracts & absolute flexibility through free organization of working hours Permanent position and 30 days of vacation FlexWork: Work remotely from other European countries for up to 3 months per year Monthly budget for individually selectable benefits from over 50 possible offers via emplu, various offers via corporate benefits, as well as bicycle and car leasing via salary conversion Mental Health Benefit 'Nilo' – 10 free sessions with psychologists annually as well as access to meditations and courses We provide you with targeted support in your professional and personal development at Natuvion Mentoring program for a structured and personal induction Be part of the #teamgreen - At Natuvion, you'll work on innovative projects as part of a team that stands up for each other. We rely on cooperation, openness and trust Modern equipment and central offices in Walldorf, Berlin, Munich and Leipzig Your long-term perspective is important to us, which is why we subsidize your company pension scheme as well as capital-forming benefits About Natuvion Natuvion builds software and provides consulting for enterprise data transformations — migrations, restructurings, carve-outs, and system retirements, primarily in the SAP ecosystem. Founded in 2014 in Walldorf, Germany, the company employs around 500 people across Germany, Austria, Switzerland, the United States, Slovakia, and Australia. Natuvion has been part of NTT DATA Business Solutions since 2022. Natuvion holds SAP Gold Partner status. Customers include BMW, Volkswagen, E.ON, Vattenfall, Carlsberg, Lufthansa, BASF, and Lidl. Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
