    schema:datePosted "2026-08-25"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "Not every good idea leads to a better product experience. Reliable user insights help teams prioritize product decisions, identify risks early, and measure whether product initiatives actually work. At idealo, you will help build our research practice with a clear focus on quantitative methods. Together with Product, UX, and Data, you will combine qualitative and quantitative evidence to create a stronger basis for product decisions. Your Responsibilities You develop research strategies for complex product questions. You select the right qualitative and quantitative research methods. You design measurement frameworks and define meaningful success metrics. You assess study designs, sample sizes, bias risks, and statistical results. You connect product data with qualitative and quantitative research insights. When evidence improves a product decision, the impact of your work is visible. Skills & Requirements Must-have Several years or more of UX Research experience with a quantitative focus. You are confident using qualitative and quantitative research methods. You apply significance tests, correlations, and regression analyses. You understand complex study designs and data triangulation. You conduct qualitative interviews confidently in German and English. You take ownership and independently drive topics forward. Nice-to-have Experience with survey design, sampling, scaling, and questionnaire design. Experience using AI tools to support research or analysis workflows. At idealo you can expect You want to further your education? We take your personal development goals seriously and, in addition to our idealo Learning Hub, eLearning offerings (e.g., Udemy), coaching & mediation, we also offer you the opportunity to benefit individually from additional learning and development budget. And what about the office? Our office in the heart of Berlin offers free organic breakfast, excellent free lunch (vegan and vegetarian), as well as free coffee, lemonades and after-work beer, in addition to the \"standard foosball\". It also has a fabulous rooftop terrace with view of the whole of berlin where you can network with colleagues from our group of companies. In need of additional support in any areas of your life? We offer free counseling and support in all areas of life (professional, private, family, health, etc.) in cooperation with the pme-Familienservice. You want full flexibility on your way to work and beyond? No problem with a job bike or Deutschlandticket - and it's environmentally friendly, too! Want to keep yourself fit? We offer many different fitness and sports options, such as an Urban Sports or Gympass membership, to suit your personal needs. And what else is there? Of course, success must be celebrated! In addition to team events, you can also expect big company events and other moments of organized connection with others in the company and your team throughout the year! #LI-NY1 Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
