    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><strong>Who We Are </strong></p> <p>Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With 30 offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://verve.com/\">verve.com</a>.<strong><br></strong></p></div><p><strong>What You Will Do</strong></p> <ul> <li>Lead hiring for a wide range of roles, with a focus on industry-specific roles such as Commercial (Sales, Account Management, Operations), Marketing, Product, and other Corporate/Support functions</li> <li>Develop and execute proactive sourcing strategies with a focus on Germany, with some international exposure</li> <li>Partner with hiring managers and regional leaders to align hiring plans with business goals and challenges, acting as a trusted advisor</li> <li>Own end-to-end recruitment: job scoping, sourcing, assessment, interview processes, and offers</li> <li>Deliver an exceptional candidate experience that reflects the company's culture and values</li> <li>Collaborate on employer branding initiatives to position the company as an employer of choice</li> <li>Support improvements to recruitment processes, driving innovation and efficiency</li> <li>Help reduce agency reliance and optimize time-to-hire</li> <li>Maintain ATS accuracy and deliver regular recruitment reporting</li> </ul> <p><strong><br>What You Will Bring</strong></p> <ul> <li>Solid recruitment experience, either from a recruitment agency or in-house, working with niche roles</li> <li>Expertise in sourcing, networking, interviewing, and offer negotiation at all levels</li> <li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>Fluent English and German communication skills are must have</strong></li> <li>A background in commercial roles and the advertising industry is highly desirable</li> <li>Technical recruitment experience is nice to have</li> <li>Ability to work in a fast-paced, high-growth, and rapidly changing environment</li> <li>Experience with (or willingness to get involved in) organizing meet-ups, recruitment events, and other innovative ways of attracting the best talent</li> <li>A passion for telling the company story, building our brand, and establishing new processes that challenge traditional recruitment methods</li> <li>First-class interpersonal skills, with a client service-oriented mindset and acute attention to detail</li> <li>Ability to interact with all levels of the organization</li> <li>Self-motivated, with a love for working collaboratively</li> <li>Tenacity and resilience to ride the sometimes unpredictable recruitment rollercoaster</li> </ul> <p><strong>What We Offer</strong></p> <p>Just a few of the benefits waiting for you at Verve:&nbsp;</p> <ul> <li>Support your long-term financial security with our <strong>Allianz</strong> <strong>Corporate Pension Scheme</strong>&nbsp;</li> <li>Pick what matters most to you in our <strong>Personalized Benefits Platform</strong>, with a budget of €100/month: mobility support (BVG/HVV), internet allowance, daycare subsidy, <strong>Urban Sports Club</strong> membership, personal development, and shopping vouchers</li> <li>Support your mental well-being with our<strong> Nilo Health Workplace Mental Health Solution</strong></li> <li>Boost your professional knowledge with our annual<strong> training budget &amp; internal webinars,</strong> and level up your language skills through our <strong>German/English classes</strong></li> <li>Recharge with <strong>27 paid vacation days + 3 Wellness days</strong> throughout the year, in addition to the public holidays<br>… and even more reasons to join us!</li> </ul><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&nbsp;<br><br>If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, <a href=\"https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a> to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-size: 8pt;\" href=\"https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\">privacy policy</a><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"> to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.</span></p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-verve ;
