    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/intermate-media-gmbh/werkstudentin-it-hardware-office-tech-gn-berlin-312056> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-werkstudentin-marketing-sales-remote-stuttgart-408475> a prov:Entity,
