    schema:description "About You'll support our Localization Management team not only with day-to-day tasks like coordinating and tracking localization requests, but also help us bring AI-powered tools into how we run translation projects. You'll work closely with internal stakeholders, our translation team, and external partners. What you can expect Support the Localization Management team in handling localization requests from stakeholders across the company, from marketplace content to internal communications. Create, assign, and close localization projects in memoQ, keeping every request on track from kickoff to delivery. Build and maintain our terminology databases so translations stay consistent across markets. Perform formal QA on translated content, even in languages you don't speak yourself, checking for issues like missing HTML tags, punctuation errors, or double spaces. Manage and align style guides and project instructions per language, keeping them up to date as our Localization team's processes evolve. Check texts formally before and after publication to make sure everything goes live polished. Help us test and refine AI-powered workflows that support localization project management. What sets you apart You're studying translation, linguistics, or a related field. You can judge the formal quality of a translation, even without speaking the language yourself. Your eye for detail catches spelling and grammar mistakes that others might miss. You're comfortable with digital tools and common office applications, and you pick up new systems quickly. You're curious about AI-powered tools and enjoy exploring how they can support translation and localization work. You bring proactive thinking, team spirit, and self-motivated follow-through. You're flexible and open to evolving processes as our team's workflows grow. What we offer Benefit App: Discover our Benefit App, which offers you complete flexibility. Whether for your sports activities, as a childcare subsidy, or as a flexible mobility budget, with an additional monthly budget of 80 Euro per person, you can use the benefits individually and tailor them to your needs! Free lunch: Enjoy a free lunch that will give you energy for the rest of the day. Delicious food that brings the team together – one more reason to look forward to your lunch break! Additional day off on December 24 and 31: Look forward to an additional day off on December 24 and 31 to enjoy the holidays to the fullest. This leaves more time for family, friends, and festive preparations! Work from abroad 20 days/year: Take advantage of the opportunity to work from abroad for up to 20 days a year and discover new cultures. Working with a view of the sea? Yes, please! Diversity@Chrono24: We believe in the power of diversity. Diversity is our strength. At Chrono24, we embrace diversity because we believe it enriches not only our corporate culture but also our success. Be yourself – and let’s achieve great things together! Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
